<title>USA: Zoom names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Zoom names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zoom Telephonics Inc said Tuesday it named Robert Crist as vice president of finance and chief financial officer of the company.</p>
<p>Crist will join Zoom from Wang Laboratories Inc, where he was involved in the sale of the Wang Software Business unit to Eastman Kodak Co, it said.</p>
<p>Zoom, which makes modems, did not say who Crist was replacing, and its officials could not be reached for comment.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
